{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>It shall be reckoned as the field of the land.</b> Like ויבואו האנשים על הנשים (and the men came upon the women). It means 'with.'" "<b>It shall have redemption.</b> For every house, like בנות צעדה עלי שור, and like על בניה כי איננו."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {0 "The phrase ופי׳ עם is terse: 'the explanation is עם (with),' i.e., על here carries the sense of עם."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:25.206152369Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}